@startuml 12-load-pipeline
!pragma layout smetana
' 装载流水线：Content 输入 -> AST -> GameProc 收尾 -> 诊断
' 来源：Content/erb_loader.h, GameData/ast, GameProc/load_passes.h, parse_checks.h

title 装载流水线（当前实现）

actor User
participant "Content::ErbLoader" as Loader
participant "declaration scan" as Scan
participant "GameData/ast::AstBuilder" as Builder
participant "GameProc::EraParseTable" as Table
participant "loadpass" as LoadPass
participant "parsecheck" as Check
participant "ParseDiagnostics" as Diagnostics

User -> Loader : loadDirectory / loadAsync
Loader -> Scan : scan declarations once
Scan --> Loader : Scan + preprocessed content
Loader -> Builder : buildScriptAst(lines, declarations)
Builder --> Loader : BuiltScript{lines, scan}
Loader -> Table : loadScript(script, builtScript)
Table -> LoadPass : finalize declarations / bindings
LoadPass -> Check : resolve targets / structures / static values
Check -> Diagnostics : replaceOrigin(pass, sink)
Diagnostics --> User : load diagnostics

note right of Builder
  Declarations are registered before AST construction.
  The current implementation does not contain a later
  function recompilation or assignment AST rebuild stage.
end note

note right of Table
  The table drives explicit load phases:
  Empty -> Loading -> Bound -> Finalized.
  Passes receive typed views and own diagnostic origins;
  repeated finalization replaces those origins.
end note

legend bottom
  Content reads and preprocesses files. GameData/ast owns nodes
  and diagnostics. GameProc owns orchestration and pass ordering.
endlegend
@enduml
